---
import Heading from "./uiwave/Heading.astro";
---

<section class="section-padding">
        <div class="container-site max-w-3xl">
            <Heading title="Common Questions" subtitle="FAQ" />
            <div class="mt-10 space-y-3">
                <details class="card-surface group">
                    <summary
                        class="cursor-pointer list-none p-5 font-display text-lg font-semibold uppercase text-primary marker:content-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"
                    >
                        <span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                            How do I book a free consultation? <span
                                class="text-primary-container transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"
                                aria-hidden="true">+</span
                            >
                        </span>
                    </summary>
                    <div
                        class="border-t border-surface-high px-5 pb-5 pt-4 text-on-surface-variant"
                    >
                        Visit our Book page to schedule a 30-minute video or
                        in-person consultation. We'll discuss your goals,
                        training history, and recommend the best program for
                        you. No obligation to sign up.
                    </div>
                </details><details class="card-surface group">
                    <summary
                        class="cursor-pointer list-none p-5 font-display text-lg font-semibold uppercase text-primary marker:content-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"
                    >
                        <span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                            What is your cancellation policy? <span
                                class="text-primary-container transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"
                                aria-hidden="true">+</span
                            >
                        </span>
                    </summary>
                    <div
                        class="border-t border-surface-high px-5 pb-5 pt-4 text-on-surface-variant"
                    >
                        Monthly memberships can be cancelled with 30 days
                        notice. Session packages are non-refundable but can be
                        transferred. We believe in earning your business every
                        month — no long-term contracts required.
                    </div>
                </details><details class="card-surface group">
                    <summary
                        class="cursor-pointer list-none p-5 font-display text-lg font-semibold uppercase text-primary marker:content-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"
                    >
                        <span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                            What certifications do you hold? <span
                                class="text-primary-container transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"
                                aria-hidden="true">+</span
                            >
                        </span>
                    </summary>
                    <div
                        class="border-t border-surface-high px-5 pb-5 pt-4 text-on-surface-variant"
                    >
                        Coach Alex Vega is NSCA-CPT certified with additional
                        credentials in sports nutrition and corrective exercise.
                        All programming follows evidence-based principles from
                        exercise science literature.
                    </div>
                </details><details class="card-surface group">
                    <summary
                        class="cursor-pointer list-none p-5 font-display text-lg font-semibold uppercase text-primary marker:content-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"
                    >
                        <span class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                            What equipment do I need? <span
                                class="text-primary-container transition-transform group-open:rotate-45"
                                aria-hidden="true">+</span
                            >
                        </span>
                    </summary>
                    <div
                        class="border-t border-surface-high px-5 pb-5 pt-4 text-on-surface-variant"
                    >
                        It depends on your program. In-person clients train at
                        our fully equipped facility. Online clients receive
                        programs tailored to their available equipment — from
                        full commercial gyms to minimal home setups.
                    </div>
                </details>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>